{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leap, dash, and vault through an endless adrenaline rush!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platform Vault is a <strong>high-stakes infinite runner</strong> where hesitation means disaster. Every jump is permanent\u00a0<strong>no turning back</strong>\u00a0as platforms shift, and crumble beneath you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf1f Game Modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic</strong> - Test your endurance in an ever-accelerating gauntlet</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time Attack</strong> - Race against the clock in a blistering sprint</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random Mode</strong> - Wild, unpredictable platforms for maximum chaos</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Progression</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock <strong>new character</strong> and <strong>cosmetics</strong> with in-run gold</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated <strong>platforms with unique behaviors</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfc6 Challenge Yourself</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete on <strong>global leaderboards</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3857410?t=1757885922","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857410/9977fcef1e958d6d48f19680b191035fff2883c4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757885922","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857410/d26f2dae433e4f4fa41fdd76df7b60c5046e3063/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757885922","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857410/d26f2dae433e4f4fa41fdd76df7b60c5046e3063/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757885922","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"